        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>业绩综述 - 财产保险业务</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 50px 0; \n        color: #333;\n        background-color: #fff;\n    }\n    \n    .page-container {\n        max-width: 1100px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        padding: 0 60px;\n        position: relative;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    /* Header Styles */\n    .header-section {\n        margin-bottom: 50px;\n    }\n    .main-title {\n        font-size: 38px;\n        color: #333;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin: 0 0 5px 0;\n        letter-spacing: 2px;\n    }\n    .sub-title {\n        font-size: 42px;\n        color: #eb6100;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin: 0;\n        letter-spacing: 2px;\n    }\n\n    /* Sub-header */\n    .section-header {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        color: #008e57;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin: 0 0 40px 0;\n    }\n\n    /* Main Content Area */\n    .content-container {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        width: 92%; /* Leave space for the right tab */\n    }\n\n    /* Row Item */\n    .data-row {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: stretch; /* Keep columns same height for the border */\n    }\n\n    /* Left Column (Stats) */\n    .stat-col {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: row;\n        align-items: flex-start;\n        width: 260px;\n        flex-shrink: 0;\n        margin-right: 30px;\n        padding-top: 5px;\n    }\n    .placeholder.icon {\n        width: 46px;\n        height: 46px;\n        border: 2px solid #eb6100;\n        border-radius: 14px;\n        color: #eb6100;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n        font-size: 10px;\n        text-align: center;\n        line-height: 1.2;\n        margin-right: 15px;\n        flex-shrink: 0;\n        background-color: transparent;\n    }\n    \n    .stat-text-block {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .stat-number-wrapper {\n        color: #eb6100;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: baseline;\n        line-height: 1;\n    }\n    .stat-prefix {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        margin-right: 3px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .stat-number {\n        font-size: 40px;\n        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .stat-unit {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        margin-left: 3px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .stat-label {\n        font-size: 16px;\n        color: #111;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n        font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    /* Right Column (Descriptions) */\n    .desc-col {\n        flex: 1;\n    }\n    .desc-wrapper {\n        padding-bottom: 25px;\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n        border-bottom: 1px dashed #f5d5c6;\n    }\n    .data-row:last-child .desc-wrapper {\n        border-bottom: none;\n        padding-bottom: 0;\n        margin-bottom: 0;\n    }\n\n    .desc-title-wrapper {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n    .bullet {\n        width: 7px;\n        height: 7px;\n        border: 2.5px solid #eb6100;\n        border-radius: 50%;\n        margin-right: 8px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        display: inline-block;\n    }\n    .desc-title {\n        font-size: 16px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        color: #222;\n        margin: 0;\n    }\n    .desc-text {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        color: #555;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        margin: 0;\n        text-align: justify;\n    }\n    \n    /* Right side tab */\n    .side-tab {\n        position: absolute;\n        right: 0;\n        top: 240px;\n        background-color: #eb6100;\n        color: white;\n        padding: 25px 10px;\n        border-radius: 12px 0 0 12px;\n        writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        letter-spacing: 5px;\n        font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    /* Footer */\n    .footer {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        align-items: flex-end;\n        margin-top: 80px;\n    }\n    .footer-left {\n        color: #eb6100;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .footer-right {\n        color: #999;\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .footer-page-num {\n        font-size: 22px;\n        margin-left: 8px;\n        color: #666;\n        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page-container\">\n    \n    <div class=\"header-section\">\n        <h1 class=\"main-title\">业绩综述</h1>\n        <h2 class=\"sub-title\">财产保险业务</h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3 class=\"section-header\">财产保险业务概览</h3>\n\n    <div class=\"content-container\">\n        \n        <!-- Row 1 -->\n        <div class=\"data-row\">\n            <div class=\"stat-col\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder icon\">[Icon:<br>Money Bag]</div>\n                <div class=\"stat-text-block\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-number-wrapper\">\n                        <span class=\"stat-number\">98.3</span>\n                        <span class=\"stat-unit\">%</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">整体综合成本率</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"desc-col\">\n                <div class=\"desc-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"desc-title-wrapper\">\n                        <span class=\"bullet\"></span>\n                        <h4 class=\"desc-title\">稳健增长助力高质量发展</h4>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"desc-text\">\n                        2024年，平安产险业务保持稳定增长，实现保险服务收入3,281.46亿元，同比增长4.7%。平安产险整体综合成本率98.3%，同比优化2.3个百分点，主要由保证保险业务承保损失下降影响。\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 2 -->\n        <div class=\"data-row\">\n            <div class=\"stat-col\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder icon\">[Icon:<br>Shield]</div>\n                <div class=\"stat-text-block\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-number-wrapper\">\n                        <span class=\"stat-number\">220</span>\n                        <span class=\"stat-unit\">万亿元</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">小微企业风险保障</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"desc-col\">\n                <div class=\"desc-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"desc-title-wrapper\">\n                        <span class=\"bullet\"></span>\n                        <h4 class=\"desc-title\">扎实做好“五篇大文章”</h4>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"desc-text\">\n                        平安产险立足服务实体经济的要求，不断探索“保险+科技+服务”新模式，提升服务实体经济质效，扎实做好金融“五篇大文章”。2024年，平安产险累计开发覆盖20余个行业的6,500款产品，为240万小微企业提供了220万亿元风险保障；承保科技保险保单231万件，为6.9万家科技企业提供9万亿元风险保障。同时，平安产险协助推进城市型定制医疗保险项目124个，覆盖市民超3,000万，提供超60万亿元风险保障；承办长期护理保险项目覆盖参保群众超1,000万，累计支付护理待遇近1.8亿元。\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 3 -->\n        <div class=\"data-row\">\n            <div class=\"stat-col\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder icon\">[Icon:<br>App/Car]</div>\n                <div class=\"stat-text-block\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-number-wrapper\">\n                        <span class=\"stat-prefix\">近</span>\n                        <span class=\"stat-number\">2.36</span>\n                        <span class=\"stat-unit\">亿</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">“平安好车主”<br>注册用户数</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"desc-col\">\n                <div class=\"desc-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"desc-title-wrapper\">\n                        <span class=\"bullet\"></span>\n                        <h4 class=\"desc-title\">推进高水平科技自立自强</h4>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"desc-text\">\n                        “平安好车主”APP致力于提供涵盖“车保险、车服务、车生活”的一站式服务，搭建82项服务覆盖用车全场景，洞察客户需求，精准推荐服务，客户满意度超97%。截至2024年12月末，“平安好车主”注册用户数近2.36亿，月活跃用户数峰值突破4,100万。\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 4 -->\n        <div class=\"data-row\">\n            <div class=\"stat-col\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder icon\">[Icon:<br>Siren]</div>\n                <div class=\"stat-text-block\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-number-wrapper\">\n                        <span class=\"stat-number\">105.5</span>\n                        <span class=\"stat-unit\">亿次</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-label\">发出灾害预警<br>信息累计次数</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"desc-col\">\n                <div class=\"desc-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"desc-title-wrapper\">\n                        <span class=\"bullet\"></span>\n                        <h4 class=\"desc-title\">风险减量提升服务质效</h4>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"desc-text\">\n                        中国平安联合中国灾害防御协会主办“平安守护·防患未‘燃’”公益活动，发布《城市重点消防安全与火灾防控指引》系列丛书，与中央财经大学、北京师范大学等机构联合发布《科技赋能风险减量服务白皮书》，提升公众灾害风险意识和防范能力。平安产险自主研发“鹰眼系统DRS3.0”，包含自然灾害、意外事故、安责服务、万物互联四大模块，2024年累计发出台风、暴雨、洪水等灾害预警信息105.5亿次，覆盖6,734万个人及企业客户，助力提升防灾减灾应急能力。\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Right Side Tab -->\n    <div class=\"side-tab\">\n        经营情况讨论及分析\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-left\">二零二四年年报</div>\n        <div class=\"footer-right\">中国平安保险（集团）股份有限公司<span class=\"footer-page-num\">39</span></div>\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
